#problem(1)[
已知全集 $U = \{x | 2 <= x <= 5 , x in RR \}$，集合 $A = \{x | 2 <= x < 4, x in RR \}$，则 $overline(A)=$#blank(){}.
]

#answer([$overline(A)= \{x | 4 <= x <= 5 , x in RR \}=[4,5]$])

#solution[
根据补集定义，$overline(A)= \{x | x in U, x in.not A\}$. 又 $U=\{x\m i d2 <= x <= 5 \}$，所以 $overline(A)=\{x\m i d4 <= x <= 5 \}$.
]

